# tRPC.panel()

Probably the easiest and cheapest way to build a testing UI and documentation for your tRPC endpoints. tRPC panel REDACTEDmatically generates a UI for manually test
ing your tRPC backend with 0 overhead:

![Screenshot 2022-12-08 at 7 24 02 PM](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/12774588/206602120-017a2b3a-66c3-4bf0-bd93-90fb4bddf0cc.png)

